{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/36b33a7362e1f3e4693efcd71637e324.poster.avif?t=1767713976\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/36b33a7362e1f3e4693efcd71637e324.webm?t=1767713976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/36b33a7362e1f3e4693efcd71637e324.mp4?t=1767713976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bard\u2019s Fault takes the addictive loop of the Survivor genre and adds the one thing missing: <strong>Your Friends</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FELLOWSHIP ENGINE (Co-op)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Don't fight alone: Interact between characters to generate unique combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Synergy Matters: Each character brings abilities that shape the team\u2019s composition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/5729fb64e9c4004bf2cbd6cc38b5d256.poster.avif?t=1767713976\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/5729fb64e9c4004bf2cbd6cc38b5d256.webm?t=1767713976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/5729fb64e9c4004bf2cbd6cc38b5d256.mp4?t=1767713976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE TREE OF TIME (Meta-Progression)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Fail Forward: Dying is part of the plan. Your characters remember every loop, allowing you to return to the Tree of Time, upgrade your character, and investigate the cause of your own demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Uncover the Mystery: Why is the timeline broken? Unlock narrative threads that persist across runs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR SYMPHONY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Build Crafting: Choose from  cards, items, and bonus skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Visual Clarity: Enjoy a vibrant and cozy art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3195470?t=1767713976","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3195470?t=1767713976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/54e93fbdf86fdabd0e1398df86b7231a9dc197b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767713976","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/54e93fbdf86fdabd0e1398df86b7231a9dc197b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767713976","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/36b33a7362e1f3e4693efcd71637e324.poster.avif?t=1767713976\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195470/extras/36b33a7362e1f3e4693efcd71637e324.webm?t=1767713976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app